^rollout\.sh: another rollout\.sh --auto holds ~/\.cache/repo-ci-baseline/rollout-auto\.lock, or a review session or gate an earlier one started is still running; nothing run\. See what holds it with: fuser -v ~/\.cache/repo-ci-baseline/rollout-auto\.lock \(or lsof ~/\.cache/repo-ci-baseline/rollout-auto\.lock\), and end it only when no round is running; then run: rollout\.sh --auto --brings '#80'$
